{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1438381-new-terrestrial-spell-grass-of-palms","id":1438381,"title":"New Terrestrial Spell - Grass Of Palms","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-03-06T15:55:38-08:00","id":1438381,"title":"New Terrestrial Spell - Grass Of Palms","content":"<b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Grass Of Palms</span></b><br /> <br /> <i>A comparatively slow but flexible spell for toting large amounts of supplies or passengers. Sacrifices speed for massive carrying capacity.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Cost:</b> 15sm, 1wp<br /> <b>Keywords:</b> None<br /> <b>Duration:</b> One day and night<br /> <br /> The caster casts his will like seeds upon the ground, and soft hands of green and ashy shadow reach up from it. These hands form a carpet that spreads across the earth or floor and can carry great weights.<br /> <br /> When the spell is cast, the hands spread out to cover the ground within short range of the caster. At the caster's behest, they will pick up anything or anyone that holds still for them, and carry it to where-ever the caster wishes by passing it from hand to hand at about 4 mph. Each individual hand is very strong; they can support a weight of about two thousand pounds per square foot of area - or, marble stacked twelve feet high, iron stacked four feet high, ice stacked thirty feet high, or flour stacked sixty feet high.<br /> <br /> The hands will appear on very steep slopes, but not ceilings or vertical walls.<br /> <br /> The hands follow the caster as he travels, fading in to the earth as he departs or rising from the earth as he arrives. If the caster travels faster than the palms can pass cargo, then they set it down gently upon the ground as they vanish. The ride is very smooth for cargo and passengers alike.<br /> <br /> The hands do not appear on the surface of water or other liquids, only on solid surfaces.<br /> <br /> The hands catch the sorcerer if he lands on them, reducing damage as though he had fallen one range category less.<br /> <br /> <i>Control Spell:</i> &quot;Sticky Palms.&quot; The grass of palms appears on vertical walls and ceilings as well. It can pull as well as it lifts, and pass the caster and his possessions along ceilings or walls. Additionally, the caster may make Withering attacks against anyone within the palms as though they were a light throwing weapon, wielded with (Wits+Occult) and using Intelligence to calculate base damage. They may also use a Grapple gambit, but the hands will only Restrain And Drag, never Savage or Throw.<br /> <br /> <i>Distortion (Goal Number 20):</i> Instead of picking up whatever the caster commands and putting it where he desires, the hands pick up everything that holds still for them and carry it away from the caster. At the edge of the grass of palms, they drop it indelicately.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/587-kukla","name":"Kukla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar587_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-07T05:37:11-08:00","id":1438458,"title":"","content":"I like it. It's a fittingly weird and interesting way for sorcery to provide a means of remotely carrying stuff. Definitely seems like it would make for a striking image within a travelling sorcerer's procession.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-07T06:03:02-08:00","id":1438460,"title":"","content":"It could stand to be a <i>smidge</i> faster.<br /> <br /> Cloud Trapeze is Celestial Circle, but it's 30 to 50 mph and includes flight.<br /> <br /> This can't fly and though it certainly shouldn't be faster than a Celestial spell, but I think you'd be safe making this default to walking speed, but if the Sorcerer moves faster then the hands will keep pace up to 10mph before giving up and vanishing. Might be a little wordy.<br /> <br /> Also... how long is the duration?<br /> <br /> Is it 24 hours (daytime and nighttime) or 36 hours (one day then one night)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 03-07-2021, 09:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-07T14:41:25-08:00","id":1438502,"title":"","content":"Yeah I think you could bump it to something like (Intelligence + Essence) mph, but this seems like something you use when you're moving in caravan, so it doesn't need to be <i>that</i> fast, so long as it carries a hell of a lot more than Stormwind Rider. You'd expect the gap between this and Cloud Trapeze to be on the order of the gap between DoOB and Cantata, after all.<br /> <br /> My primary comments by way of criticism are, first I think you need to give a better idea of how much the spell can hold <i>in total</i>, because &quot;out to short range&quot; doesn't cover a specific square footage and people will want to know how much they can tote; and second, as JohnDoe notes, &quot;one day and night&quot; is unusual wording. Things that last 24 hours generally list their duration as &quot;one day&quot;, and if that's not the intention then the duration might need a clarity rewrite.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/104-gayo","name":"Gayo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar104_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1948"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-07T23:37:52-08:00","id":1438531,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gayo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1438381-new-terrestrial-spell-grass-of-palms?p=1438502#post1438502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> My primary comments by way of criticism are, first I think you need to give a better idea of how much the spell can hold <i>in total</i>, because &amp;quot;out to short range&amp;quot; doesn't cover a specific square footage and people will want to know how much they can tote</div> </div> </div> </div>I was eyeballing it as &quot;basically everything within 15 feet&quot;. Because it can carry one ton per square foot... so like... well over 200 tons.<br /> <br /> You're not going to be stacking bags of flour sixty feet high. Whatever you want to carry, this can carry.<br /> <br /> Of course if that wasn't the intent, hard numbers would be great.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-08T01:54:24-08:00","id":1438540,"title":"","content":"You're right that I'm being too cute with the duration. It lasts a day.<br /> <br /> This spell is a little weak compared to Stormwind Rider because I've gently nerfed Stormwind Rider in my home game with the consent of the GM.<br /> <br /> As for weight... It can carry essentially everything. You could build a small comfortable house out of stone and cement, or a very large comfortable house out of timber, and have the grass of palms tote you and your house and all your stuff down the road at a brisk walk.<br /> <br /> As for the radius, 'everything within short range' might be a bit too vague. I imagined it being like a forty foot radius, not fifteen!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/587-kukla","name":"Kukla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar587_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-08T02:11:15-08:00","id":1438541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kukla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1438381-new-terrestrial-spell-grass-of-palms?p=1438540#post1438540\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for weight... It can carry essentially everything. You could build a small comfortable house out of stone and cement, or a very large comfortable house out of timber, and have the grass of palms tote you and your house and all your stuff down the road at a brisk walk.<br /> <br /> As for the radius, 'everything within short range' might be a bit too vague. I imagined it being like a forty foot radius, not fifteen!</div> </div> </div> </div>A 40 foot radius circle is 5027 square feet.<br /> <br /> If it can carry 10,000,000 pounds (5,000 tons), then 4mph speed is probably fine.<br /> <br /> (An average American house is 2500 square feet. A one story house with a concrete foundation weights (<a href=\"https://whatthingsweigh.com/how-much-does-a-house-weigh/\" target=\"_blank\">very approximately</a>) 200 pounds per square foot. 350 pounds for a three story house. 2000 pounds per square foot over 5000 square feet is carrying a very large ten-story mansion of stone. I like it. I <i>really </i>like it.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 03-08-2021, 10:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-08T06:54:11-08:00","id":1438562,"title":"","content":"...Yeah, if the hand patch as a whole can carry a Nexus apartment building then drop all the numbers and just say that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-09T04:51:38-08:00","id":1438720,"title":"","content":"Really like this. Seems very fitting for a Mnemon to use it to set big blocks into place during some sort of massive pyramid-esque construction project...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24647-moss-reynholm","name":"Moss Reynholm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24647_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-09T05:07:01-08:00","id":1438723,"title":"","content":"I could be cute and suppose that dense material stacked very high is at risk of becoming unbalanced and tip over to crush people, but I think it's in the spirit of things to just assume that hands at the margins can stretch up and over to brace it from the sides.<br /> <br /> Maybe they even get inside of a building to prevent the ceiling from caving in.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-09T06:14:04-08:00","id":1438729,"title":"","content":"Sounds handy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-09T09:24:37-08:00","id":1438752,"title":"","content":"I really like this spell and want to let my players have access to this. However I post all of the homebrew I let my players use on an Obsidian Portal game where I am building my own alt setting for exalted, which is where I would put this spell, in theory. I wanted to ask if you were ok with this and how you would want it noted if so. I will provide a link if you wish to look it over, although I admit I am hesitant to do so, as the last time I shared anything in this forum I was flamed off the site for several years and this is my first real attempt back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24509-lupislacertus","name":"Lupislacertus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-09T14:01:25-08:00","id":1438802,"title":"","content":"Lupislacertus, by the power vested in me as the originator of this content by the copy-right laws of the U.S. Congress, I grant you a non-exclusive license to reproduce this material and derivative works of this material for all non-commercial personal use, indefinitely, insofar as so doing does not conflict with my own right to continue to reproduce this material for my own personal and commercial use.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/587-kukla","name":"Kukla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar587_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-09T15:43:33-08:00","id":1438831,"title":"","content":"Thank you much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24509-lupislacertus","name":"Lupislacertus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-09T18:52:58-08:00","id":1438862,"title":"","content":"A revision of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1438381-new-terrestrial-spell-grass-of-palms\">Grass of Palms</a>. In addition to a pile of the kind of pedantic clarifications that inexplicably bring me joy, I tweaked the control spell benefit slightly and found a more elegant way to phrase how the hands work together to pick up preposterously heavy burdens - or, in the case of someone else's house, why they probably cannot pick up that burden.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Road of Hands</b></u><br /> <br /> <b>Cost:</b> 15sm, 1wp<br /> <b>Keywords:</b> None<br /> <b>Duration:</b> One day<br /> <br /> The caster casts his will like seeds upon the ground, and soft hands of green and ashy shadow reach up from it. These hands form a carpet that spreads across the earth or floor and carries great weights at a steady pace.<br /> <br /> When the spell is cast, the hands spread out to cover the ground within short range (~40ft) of the caster. At the caster's behest, they will pick up anything or anyone that allow it, and carry it to where-ever the caster wishes by passing it from hand to hand at about 4 mph. The ride is very smooth for cargo and passengers alike.<br /> <br /> The hands can carry almost anything by working together. Every square foot of surface produces four ghostly hands. Each hand can comfortably carry five hundred pounds, which does not pass to the ground. The hands may stretch at most a yard from the surface where they appear.<br /> <br /> The hands cannot pick up structures rooted to the ground; they appear on the floor of the structure, and they cannot lift the surface they arise from. This has not stopped sorcerers from devising elaborate portable homes designed to be carried on the road of hands.<br /> <br /> Whenever the caster moves, new hands appear on surfaces that come within range. Hands out of range sink smoothly in to the earth and vanish. If the caster travels faster than the palms can pass cargo, then they set it down gently upon the ground as they vanish.<br /> <br /> The hands are not an obstacle; they're insubstantial fog to everything they are not carrying.<br /> <br /> The hands will appear on very steep slopes, but not ceilings or vertical walls. They do not appear on the surface of water or other liquids.<br /> <br /> The hands catch the sorcerer if he lands on them, reducing damage as though he had fallen one range category less.<br /> <br /> <i>Control Spell Benefit:</i> &quot;Sticky Palms.&quot; The road of hands appears on vertical walls and ceilings as well. They can pass the caster and his possessions along ceilings or walls. The caster may command the hands to restrain anyone within reach; this is a Grapple gambit aimed with Wits+Occult, with a Control roll of 5+Occult. If the gambit succeeds, the hands maintain the grapple independently without the caster needing to micromanage, but they will only Restrain/Drag their victim, never Savage or Throw.<br /> <br /> <i>Distortion (Goal Number 20):</i> Instead of picking up whatever the caster commands and putting it where he desires, the hands pick up everything that holds still for them and carry it away from the caster to the edge of their reach and unceremoniously drop it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/587-kukla","name":"Kukla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar587_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-09T19:15:12-08:00","id":1438865,"title":"","content":"Reminds of that movie in which David Bowie is a troll king.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/854-light-hero","name":"light-hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar854_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-09T23:06:51-08:00","id":1438894,"title":"","content":"Another, alternative control spell benefit.<br /> <br /> <i>Control Spell Benefit:</i> &quot;Helping Hands.&quot;<br /> The road of hands are, collectively, as smart as a donkey. The caster may command a road of hands carrying his mobile home to continue down a path as long as it's safe, then sleep for the night, rightly confident that the hands will follow the twists and turns of the road and jiggle him awake if anything untoward happens.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/587-kukla","name":"Kukla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar587_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-10T00:55:43-08:00","id":1438904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>light-hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1438381-new-terrestrial-spell-grass-of-palms?p=1438865#post1438865\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Reminds of that movie in which David Bowie is a troll king.</div> </div> </div> </div>Goblin King, Goblin King! Take this light-hero away from me!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-10T02:05:16-08:00","id":1438909,"title":"","content":"I'd try and be more compact in the description. &quot;Extends out to &lt;range band or fixed measurement&gt; and can lift several tons of cargo, automatically succeeding at STR 7 feats to lift and move it along the spell's area&quot; should suffice as far as the dimensions and carrying capacity matter. Or something like it. Going through the hoops to measure any individual hand's lift or translating that to cargo density will fly over the heads of almost anyone and doesn't really matter for what this spell tries to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-10T10:39:40-08:00","id":1438965,"title":"","content":"The strength chart doesn\u2019t go up to \u201chouse\u201d so I wouldn\u2019t reference feats of strength at all, just say what the biggest and heaviest thing the spell can carry is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-10T13:52:39-08:00","id":1439021,"title":"","content":"Lift a Yeddim is, like, 44,000 lb and the top Feat of Strength at 10+. Which is considerably less than this spell as written can lift.<br /> <br /> Even descriptive, lift a house is (approximately) 400,000 lb -- almost an order of magnitude more. Spell as written can lift over twice that. Nearly three times as much.<br /> <br /> It's arguably more wordy, but you could say it succeeds at all Feats of Strength to lift and carry, upto the weight of a stone house. You might still get weird edge cases.<br /> <br /> I think the current write up is fine. It says exactly what the spell can and can't carry, and it includes the math for those interested.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-10T17:53:33-08:00","id":1439077,"title":"","content":"I just love math, y'know? I love quantifying things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/587-kukla","name":"Kukla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar587_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-11T14:51:10-08:00","id":1439294,"title":"","content":"Love this spell - I think I have a few ideas on how to use or abuse it in my current game for an NPC sorceress my players keep safe/annoy the hell out of.<br /> <br /> And the ability to control it like a trained donkey seems perfectly fitting. Love the idea of a sorcerer with a &quot;mobile home&quot; that is just picked up and sat down whenever.<br /> <br /> <br /> ...how do the shadow hands handle passing over water? Can they cross a river? Would they simply &quot;walk&quot; down into the water and along the river bottom? Do they float above the water?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-11T15:43:51-08:00","id":1439310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>webkilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1438381-new-terrestrial-spell-grass-of-palms?p=1439294#post1439294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Love this spell - I think I have a few ideas on how to use or abuse it in my current game for an NPC sorceress my players keep safe/annoy the hell out of.</div> </div> </div> </div>Excellent.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>webkilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1438381-new-terrestrial-spell-grass-of-palms?p=1439294#post1439294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And the ability to control it like a trained donkey seems perfectly fitting. Love the idea of a sorcerer with a &quot;mobile home&quot; that is just picked up and sat down whenever.</div> </div> </div> </div>The best bit is when you outsource control of the hands to a driver who steers while you nap because you can do that with a donkey.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>webkilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1438381-new-terrestrial-spell-grass-of-palms?p=1439294#post1439294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...how do the shadow hands handle passing over water? Can they cross a river? Would they simply &quot;walk&quot; down into the water and along the river bottom? Do they float above the water?</div> </div> </div> </div>They walk down in to the water and along the river bottom. This is not a substitute for a bridge, unfortunately. But if the river is no deeper than a yard, the hands could stretch just out of the water and ferry you across the surface.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/587-kukla","name":"Kukla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar587_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-15T09:06:27-07:00","id":1440044,"title":"","content":"awesome! this'll make for some hilarious hijinks when my players show up to where they &quot;know&quot; the sorcerers lives and just finds and empty lot","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}